{"sections":{"hero":{"type":"section-hero","blocks":{"story-hero-kicker-block":{"type":"kicker","disabled":true,"settings":{"kicker":"<p>Introducing<\/p>","enable_line":false,"text_size":3}},"story-hero-heading-block":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"<p>Our Story<\/p>","text_size":10}}},"block_order":["story-hero-kicker-block","story-hero-heading-block"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"height":"use_screen_one_fifth","overlay_opacity":50,"overlay_color":"#000000","enable_overlay_text":false,"preload_image":true,"content_width":2000,"text_align":"align--middle-center","text_color":"text--white","color_bg":"hero__content--transparent","width":"wrapper--none","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}},"main":{"type":"page","disabled":true,"settings":{"kicker":"","kicker_size":3,"show_title":false,"title_size":8,"show_content":true,"content_size":5,"align_text":"text-center","text_color":"text--neutral","bg":"palette--light bg--accent","width":"wrapper--narrow","padding_top":64,"padding_bottom":64}},"custom-content-2":{"type":"section-custom-content","blocks":{"custom-content-2-1":{"type":"video","settings":{"object_position":"center-center","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/2018_08_13_Headshot_Chris.jpg","video_link":"","popup_text":"","kicker":"","title":"","richtext":"","text_align":"align--middle-center","text_color":"text--white","overlay_opacity":0,"overlay_color":"#000000","link_text":"","link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/faq","button_color":"btn--white","button_style":"btn--soft"}},"custom-content-2-0":{"type":"text","settings":{"kicker":"Chris Dearborn","title":"","text":"<p>I've always been a different kind of guy - someone who gets so focused on the details that I sometimes miss the obvious things right in front of me. For some reason I was extremely dissatisfied with the underwear selection I got in high school, so I began exploring just about every men's underwear brand out there. My journey with Real Men Apparel began as a customer searching for better underwear.<\/p><p>I was drawn to their unique approach of using mannequins instead of objectifying live models in their marketing. Following an inner prompting, I reached out to the company owner Jared. This led to a three-hour video chat where my customer journey transformed into a partnership.<\/p><p>Today, as Marketing Manager, I'm passionate about challenging societal narratives about what makes a \"real man.\" Instead of focusing on what divides us, I want to create space for meaningful conversations about masculinity. Through Real Men Apparel, we're building more than just comfortable underwear - we're creating a space where men can discover more about themselves and how God made them.<\/p><p><\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/in\/christopher-t-dearborn\/\" title=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/in\/christopher-t-dearborn\/\">Chris's Linkedin<\/a><\/p>","font_size":5,"text_columns":1,"align_text":"text-left","button_text":"Discover Your Fit","button_url":"#open-quiz-tools\/perfect-product-finder\/perfect-underwear-fit-quiz","button_color":"btn--secondary","button_style":"btn btn--long","text_color":"text--neutral","bg_color":"#f7f7f7"}}},"block_order":["custom-content-2-1","custom-content-2-0"],"settings":{"height":"use_screen_one_half","brick_gutter":0,"borders":false,"bg_color":"#f8f8f8","preload_image":false,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}},"custom-content-1":{"type":"section-custom-content","blocks":{"custom-content-1-0":{"type":"video","settings":{"object_position":"center-center","video_link":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=_9VUPq3SxOc","popup_text":"Learn our story","kicker":"","title":"","richtext":"","text_align":"align--middle-center","text_color":"text--white","overlay_opacity":55,"overlay_color":"#000000","link_text":"","link":"","button_color":"btn--white","button_style":"btn"}},"custom-content-1-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"kicker":"Quality first","title":"","text":"<p>We started making the products we wanted to see in the world and we did this with an uncompromising approach to sustainability.<\/p>","font_size":5,"text_columns":1,"align_text":"text-left","button_text":"","button_url":"","button_color":"btn--neutral","button_style":"btn-text-thick-line","text_color":"text--neutral","bg_color":"#f7f7f7"}}},"block_order":["custom-content-1-0","custom-content-1-1"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"height":"use_screen_one_half","brick_gutter":0,"borders":false,"bg_color":"","preload_image":false,"width":"wrapper--full","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"icons":{"type":"section-icons","blocks":{"icons-0":{"type":"icon_block","settings":{"icon_name":"icon-basket-return","icon_color":"#aaaaaa","title":"Free returns","text":"<p>Returns within 30 days receive a full refund.<\/p>","link_text":"","link_url":""}},"icons-1":{"type":"icon_block","settings":{"icon_name":"icon-shipment-world","icon_color":"#aaaaaa","title":"Worldwide shipping","text":"<p>Ship anywhere, rates available at checkout.<\/p>","link_text":"","link_url":""}},"icons-2":{"type":"icon_block","settings":{"icon_name":"icon-phone","icon_color":"#aaaaaa","title":"24\/7 support","text":"<p>Call us anytime at 1(800) 555-1234.<\/p>","link_text":"","link_url":""}}},"block_order":["icons-0","icons-1","icons-2"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"","bg":"palette--light bg--accent","icons_size":30,"icon_alignment":"icon--top","layout":"grid--stacked","align_text":"text-left","width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}}},"order":["hero","main","custom-content-2","custom-content-1","icons"]}